[{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"豪士宁沦鬼趣中，曼卿昔去管芙蓉。\n君今定作梅花主，来往山间傥一逢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29604,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"昔结精庐在半崖，苔扉无主阖还开。\n近闻有虎为看守，应是防闲俗子来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29605,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"元凯平生以智推，今看往事一何痴。\n山头螭首犹芜没，那有人观水底碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29606,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"妓有香分客有鱼，主君头白总因渠。\n枯杨此日悲风起，寂寞无人哭墓庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29607,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同郑君瑞出濑溪即事十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"汗血名驹白玉鞭，本初父子喜华鲜。\n只今无复狂游侣，自卸驴鞍古店前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29608,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中?省谒二绝 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"□□□下挟两拐，冻皴身上披三絮。\n非为辟支放登光，自是庞公上冢去。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29609,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"安仁驿","author":"刘克庄","text":"偶向溪边洗客尘，数株如玉照青蘋。\n凄风冷雨分宜县，赖有梅花管领人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29610,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寺","author":"刘克庄","text":"人烟疏处老僧家，石路榕阴噪晚鸦。\n欲挈庞公妻子去，幅巾阁上读楞伽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29611,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"冰衔常恁么，雪鬓转皤然。\n一事差堪喜，诗多似去年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29612,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"儿童烧爆竹，妇女治椒花。\n独有龙钟叟，凄凉感岁华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29613,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"瘦骨春衫薄，华颠綵胜垂。\n菱花应窃笑，妆束不相宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29614,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"草市芳菲节，柴门寂寞滨。\n桃符聊塞白，免谤作诗人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29615,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"闻说醉乡里，家家设酒垆。\n有刘伶肯饮，无李白谁沽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29616,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"细切如丝菜，添斟献颂椒。\n未曾守除夜，早已问元宵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29617,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"想见朱衣吏，催排玉笋班。\n老臣绝朝谒，北望祝南山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29618,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"卖菜犹求益，栽桃不厌多。\n小园两三树，冷淡柰春何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29619,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"岁晚佣耕者，人人诉涝乾。\n吾宁减私量，汝莫待租瘢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29620,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"甚惜光阴去，其如耄老何。\n丁宁小儿女，不必看乡傩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29621,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"门外呵寒客，鹑衣百结悬。\n藏瓶犹可扑，莫费水衡钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29622,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁除即事十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"听得先生去，抛书喜欲颠。\n吾闻渥洼种，堕地不须鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29623,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"丐客鹑衣立户前，岂知侬自窘残年。\n染人酒媪逋犹缓，且送添丁上学钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29624,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"主公晚节治家宽，婢惯奴骄号令难。\n圃在屋边慵种菜，井临砌畔怕浇兰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29625,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"岁晚郊居苦寂寥，日高盐酪去城遥。\n深深榕径苔墙里，忽有银钗叫卖樵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29626,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"门冷如冰尽不妨，由来富贵属苍苍。\n谁能却学痴儿女，深夜潜烧祭灶香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29627,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"细君炊秫婢缲丝，綵胜酥花总不知。\n窗下老儒衣露肘，挑灯自拣一年诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29628,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"郁垒钟馗尚改更，青云变幻几公卿。\n人间止有章泉叟，扑断衡山了一生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29629,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"书生元不信禨祥，老去无端虑事详。\n白发社巫云日吉，明朝渫井更苫墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29630,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"踏破侬家一径苔，双鱼去换只鸡回。\n幸然不识聱牙字，省得闲人载酒来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29631,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"日日抄书懒出门，小窗弄笔到黄昏。\n丫头婢子忙匀粉，不管先生砚水浑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29632,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"岁晚书事十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"荒苔野蔓上篱笆，客至多疑不在家。\n病眼看人殊草草，隔林迢递见梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29633,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆老需云溪诗","author":"刘克庄","text":"虚空自在由舒卷，岩穴何曾碍往回。\n只向旁山依水住，莫教行雨出溪来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29634,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"贵人列屋贮倾城，公独斋居彻骨清。\n七帙高年高上品，夜窗相伴一寒檠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29635,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"久立红云一朵边，合于仙里珥貂蝉。\n偶然梦到人间世，犹拥旌旗管洞天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29636,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"曾游楚泽咏江蓠，亦向闽山品荔枝。\n犹幸早春茶未试，故应先取建州麾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29637,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"处处鸡豚竞赛冬，皆言太守致年丰。\n老农记得庄生说，姑射仙人恐是公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29638,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"鬓犹点漆面桃红，乾道淳熙辈行空。\n不是修身存养力，自缘方寸与天通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29639,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"袖中凝香未必非，建人惟恐我公归。\n安知世有孤寒士，侧听黄麻侍衮衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29640,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庆建州叶守 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"新贵纷纷竞著鞭，明公于此独恬然。\n未曾批敕中书考，先判天官二十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29641,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戍妇词三首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"九月严霜塞下飞，连营回首望寒衣。\n将军纵上移屯奏，无柰公卿半是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29642,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戍妇词三首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"昨日人回问塞垣，阵前多有未招魂。\n营司不许分明哭，寒月家家照泪痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29643,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戍妇词三首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"织锦为书寄雁飞，功名从古恨无机。\n良人白首沙场里，何日封侯建节归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29644,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏咏文房四友 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"月似金莲炬，天如碧玉笺。\n剡藤边幅窘，写不尽遗编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29645,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏咏文房四友 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"方穿新砚众，寸眼旧岩稀。\n难倩宫娥捧，堪支织女机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29646,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏咏文房四友 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"吾墨千金价，曾登七宝床。\n终身惟守黑，断腕不书黄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29647,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"炎郁甚炊蒸，夏虫难语冰。\n家无红拂妓，捉麈自驱蝇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29648,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"莫匪并州者，轻坚耐淬磨。\n文通怀内锦，裁割已无多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29649,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"工师将考室，何止大为杗。\n支案虽微用，由来寸有长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29650,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"雪萤贫士眼，珠翠贵人身。\n自从墙角弃，无复案头亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29651,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"虽无鹦鹉鸟，亦欠琵琶姬。\n纵使敲方响，獠奴佯不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29652,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"轻薄如蝉翼，择兮风未休。\n烦劳汝威重，镇压彼轻浮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29653,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"欲系伯仁肘，难悬季子腰。\n自刊聊自用，渠刻任渠销。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29654,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效屏山书斋十咏 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"有时一画起，有时三绝编。\n朱丝弦侧畔，玉界尺傍边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29655,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏答同游","author":"刘克庄","text":"君到中峰力不加，却疑绝顶事皆誇。\n烟含晚市微分塔，日照邻州近隔沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29656,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有客","author":"刘克庄","text":"几载庭空雀可罗，朝来忽有客相过。\n似知老子条冰进，不道先生鬓雪多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29657,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"贯道堂","author":"程公许","text":"道秘不可传，非文无以贯。\n君看圣画易，风行水上涣。\n谁令鞶帨工，能使雅郑乱。\n六经日丽天，诸子云雾散。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29658,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"桓司马欲兵夫子，哥利王曾丑释迦。\n血面何须九坠臂，忮心终不怨镆铘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29659,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朱买臣庙","author":"刘克庄","text":"翁子平生最苦贫，晚将丹颈博朱轮。\n老儒五十无章绶，归去何妨且负薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29660,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"剑履崇刀笔，钧衡付蹶张。\n贾生年尚少，且去傅诸王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29661,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"至郭陪清语，留衣示别情。\n奈何凤翔骨，不得宪宗迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29662,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"著论贬临川，谈经抑老泉。\n权书并字说，究竟果谁贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29663,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"登庸局面变，报复念头差。\n贬削村夫子，褒崇笑夜叉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29664,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"虽则仇平仲，何曾问大年。\n崇宁一相拜，元祐几人全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29665,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"养成河北贼，挑致海东夷。\n空国坐朋字，乱华由党碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29666,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"恍惚天书事，庄严土木功。\n暮年王太尉，典领玉清宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29667,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"相国私英倩，将军嬖子都。\n可怜洛阳令，只问主家奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29668,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"骏马如花妾，平生不负春。\n如何飞燕语，不恕辇边人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29669,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"绿野池新凿，平泉墅又开。\n乃知造凉殿，谏者不能回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29670,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"愚哲皆根性，巫医各有传。\n参禅才一宿，学幻费三年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29671,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"荒哉穆天子，辙迹遍九垓。\n已写偃师弄，更引化人来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29672,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"先传传后学，自觉觉天民。\n鲁儒迷甚者，何以救迷人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29673,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"客有过吾庐，自言师陆朱。\n故应东海若，不及北山愚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29674,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"追日忍渴走，喝月使倒行。\n夸父骨已朽，秦皇冢亦平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29675,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"履霜行于野，绝粮厄于陈。\n伯奇父逐子，仲尼天戮民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29676,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"东行值伯伦，西去逢无功。\n不知何国土，疑是醉乡中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29677,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"青牛先已去，白鹤久方归。\n若欲分优劣，老聃贤令威。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29678,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"不必杯棬性，安能桎梏身。\n谁知千载下，有个葛天民。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29679,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂记五言十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"洞达开堂奥，荒唐说刹尘。\n儒醇明告子，释黠热瞒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29680,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"地逼难容足，天低碍举头。\n那堪去梯子，谁肯上高楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29681,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"开阁何其盛，行边寝已疏。\n绕床弹指叹，六丈圣人欤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29682,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"典领天书使，脩崇昭应祠。\n可怜有遗恨，殓不得髡缁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29683,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"升天虽可喜，削地已堪哀。\n早知守厕去，何须拔宅来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29684,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]